Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:46:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 38/48] elden: drm-msm: sm8750 dsi/dpu/adreno board support

split from 0001; folds in 0059 (setup_dither cleanup) and 0070
(recover bonded command transfer). Armada variants kept: IFPC quirks,
rot_v2 SSPP, panel 8bpc dither, sm8250 link-clock guard
